    "name": "Amplitude Identify API",
    "description": "The Amplitude Identify API allows developers to update user properties for a specific user without needing to send an accompanying event. This is useful for setting or modifying user attributes such as demographics, subscription status, or preferences outside of the normal event tracking flow. The API supports operations like set, unset, append, and prepend on user properties.\n\nContact Support:\n Name: Amplitude Support",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
